From 07eb24b33e4d20f7cddcea78ec8a7c6d837a8de8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: riscv-port <riscv-port@local>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 22:21:23 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] riscv64: strip --version-script from sysdeps meson LDFLAGS;
 add build doc

meson 1.12 sanity check applies link args twice; riscv64 binutils 2.46 rejects duplicated version tags (x86 ld tolerates). Keep -rpath parts, drop --version-script (rocm_sysdeps SONAME + RPATH isolation suffices). 8 sysdeps CMakeLists + doc; rocm-systems gitlink -> integrated commit 1435a72cc3.

